        "original_id": "a6768daf-c8ae-5050-bbcc-ef82d83c6a29",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kellyanne Conway, Sean Spicer, Donald Trump\n- Roles: U.S. Counselor to the President, White House Press Secretary, President of the United States\n- Events: Meet the Press interview, Donald Trump inauguration\n- Concepts: “Alternative facts”\n\nFacts:\n- Kellyanne Conway was born on January 20, 1967.\n- Kellyanne Conway is the Counselor to U.S. President Donald Trump.\n- On January 22, 2017, Kellyanne Conway used the phrase “alternative facts” during a Meet the Press interview.\n- During that interview, Kellyanne Conway defended White House Press Secretary Sean Spicer’s false statement about the attendance numbers at Donald Trump’s inauguration as President of the United States.",
